      "sketch.asm": ";This program copies a block of 5 data bytes starting\n; from memory location 30H to another block starting at 40H.\n\nORG 0000H\nMOV R0, #30H      ; R0 points to the source RAM address\nMOV R1, #40H      ; R1 points to the destination RAM address\nMOV R2, #05H      ; R2 acts as a counter (5 bytes to copy)\n\nBACK: \nMOV A, @R0        ; Copy byte from address in R0 to Accumulator\nMOV @R1, A        ; Copy byte from Accumulator to address in R1\nINC R0            ; Increment source pointer\nINC R1            ; Increment destination pointer\nDJNZ R2, BACK     ; Decrement counter R2; if not zero, jump to BACK\n\nEND\n\n\n"
